<title>POLAND: 6 MORE STOCKS TO TRADE LIVE ON WARSAW BOURSE DEC 2.</title>
<headline>6 MORE STOCKS TO TRADE LIVE ON WARSAW BOURSE DEC 2.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six more stocks will join the 15 issues already trading in the Warsaw bourse's continuous trade system from December 2, PAP news agency reported on Friday.</p>
<p>The six stocks are Agros , Wedel , Kety , Polifarb Cieszyn , Mostostal Export and Zywiec .</p>
